\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. What a Friend we have in Jesus,
\par All our sins and griefs to bear!
\par What a priviledge to carry
\par Everything to God in prayer!
\par O what peace we often forfeit,
\par O what needless path we bear,
\par All because we do not carry
\par Everything to God in prayer!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Have we trials and temptations?
\par Is there trouble anywhere?
\par We should never be discouraged:
\par Take it to the Lord in prayer.
\par Can we find a friend so faithful,
\par Who will all our sorrows share?
\par Jesus knows our every weakness:
\par Take it to the Lord in prayer.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Are we weak and heavy-laden,
\par Cumbered with a load of care?
\par Precious Saviour, still our refuge:
\par Take it to the Lord in prayer.
\par In His arms He'll take and shield thee.
\par Thou wilt find a solace there.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

